<title>USA: Cavalier Homes sets five-for-four split.</title>
<headline>Cavalier Homes sets five-for-four split.</headline>
<dateline>WICHITA FALLS, Texas 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cavalier Homes Inc said Wednesday that its board approved a five-for-four stock split in the form of a 25 percent stock dividend.</p>
<p>The dividend is payable November 15 to shareholders of record October 13, the company said.</p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
